WEBVTT

00:05.960 --> 00:07.290
<b>The difference is four points.</b>

00:07.790 --> 00:08.800
<b>COMMENTARY MORITAKA SUWA</b>

00:08.880 --> 00:11.590
<b>Lord Tokiyuki needs five more points
to make a comeback!</b>

00:16.890 --> 00:17.890
<b>IRKED</b>

00:17.970 --> 00:19.310
<b>What is that about?</b>

00:19.390 --> 00:21.060
<b>He's absolutely going to try
to stop him from scoring.</b>

00:21.640 --> 00:23.060
<b>ONE POINT - THREE POINTS</b>

00:23.140 --> 00:26.310
<b>He only has two arrows left.
He has to hit a head or a neck to win.</b>

00:37.410 --> 00:38.740
<b>Give up.</b>

00:38.830 --> 00:45.540
<b>It's impossible for you to make
a four-point comeback at this point!</b>

00:49.460 --> 00:50.460
<b>-My lord!
-Young Lord!</b>

00:51.050 --> 00:53.590
<b>Well, I think we've got a winner.</b>

00:56.840 --> 00:58.430
<b>Run, Chojumaru!</b>

00:58.510 --> 01:00.390
<b>You think you could be a match
for Sadamune</b>

01:00.470 --> 01:02.020
<b>just with your shooting abilities?</b>

01:02.100 --> 01:04.140
<b>You must combine evading and shooting!</b>

01:05.020 --> 01:07.400
<b><i>I have to evade while I shoot?</i></b>

01:08.520 --> 01:11.570
<b>Lord Yorishige, do you think
he understood what you meant?</b>

01:26.290 --> 01:27.370
<b><i>It's all so clear.</i></b>

01:28.170 --> 01:31.670
<b><i>When I start running,</i>
<i>my head clears, and I can see everything.</i></b>

01:33.710 --> 01:37.680
<b><i>If I aim for a dog, Sadamune will run</i>
<i>into me from my blind spot for certain.</i></b>

01:38.220 --> 01:40.850
<b><i>It's impossible for me</i>
<i>to hit a small moving target</i></b>

01:40.930 --> 01:43.850
<b><i>while trying to ward off his attacks.</i></b>

01:44.930 --> 01:46.480
<b><i>Wait, I know!</i></b>

01:47.100 --> 01:50.690
<b><i>There's one target I can aim for</i>
<i>in a split second.</i></b>

02:01.990 --> 02:05.450
<b><i>A reverse shot. You're aiming behind you?</i></b>

02:05.540 --> 02:06.580
<b><i>You idiot.</i></b>

02:06.660 --> 02:09.710
<b><i>It's called a blind spot because I'm in</i>
<i>a position where you can't shoot me.</i></b>

02:09.790 --> 02:14.000
<b><i>You can't twist your body any further</i>
<i>while you're mounted on that horse.</i></b>

02:14.550 --> 02:17.380
<b><i>I am elusive</i>
<i>and the heir to the Hojo clan.</i></b>

02:17.470 --> 02:18.630
<b>TWO POINTS</b>

02:18.720 --> 02:21.720
<b><i>While I'm running away, I can do anything!</i></b>

02:28.140 --> 02:30.230
<b>Reverse shot on the opponent's neck.
Two points!</b>

02:30.310 --> 02:31.980
<b>SUWA 3 - OGASAWARA 5
DOG-SHOOTING COMPETITION 1333</b>

02:32.060 --> 02:34.020
<b>-You did it!
-Yes!</b>

02:34.110 --> 02:35.110
<b>I get it!</b>

02:35.190 --> 02:36.240
<b>COMMENTARY MORITAKA SUWA</b>

02:36.320 --> 02:39.530
<b>If my lord aims for a dog, Sadamune
is sure to come from his blind spot.</b>

02:39.610 --> 02:41.530
<b>The angle and distance
are much more certain,</b>

02:41.620 --> 02:43.700
<b>and he's a much larger target than a dog!</b>

02:44.410 --> 02:46.500
<b>That split-second judgment.</b>

02:47.040 --> 02:50.920
<b>His sense of balance and flexible body
make acrobatic marksmanship possible.</b>

02:51.460 --> 02:56.300
<b>That boy's potential blooms
when he's on the run.</b>

02:56.960 --> 02:58.090
<b>It's decided.</b>

02:58.170 --> 03:00.340
<b>Our lord's special move is a reverse shot.</b>

03:02.760 --> 03:06.560
<b>In the future, there'll be a word that
makes a youngster's heart leap for joy.</b>

03:06.640 --> 03:07.560
<b>-What?
-What?</b>

03:14.730 --> 03:17.070
<b><i>It's not over yet!</i>
<i>It's still five to three.</i></b>

03:17.150 --> 03:18.820
<b><i>Here comes a right-handed shot.</i></b>

03:18.900 --> 03:21.530
<b><i>As long as I cover my head,</i>
<i>he can't make a comeback!</i></b>

03:31.500 --> 03:34.170
<b>A classic example
of attacking while running away.</b>

03:34.250 --> 03:35.790
<b>It's called…</b>

03:38.420 --> 03:40.630
<b>PARTHIAN SHOT</b>

03:45.220 --> 03:46.890
<b><i>The Parthian shot.</i></b>

03:47.470 --> 03:50.310
<b><i>Parthia was an ancient kingdom</i>
<i>in the Middle East.</i></b>

03:50.390 --> 03:52.850
<b><i>They used this backward-facing tactic</i>
<i>to defeat Rome,</i></b>

03:52.940 --> 03:55.310
<b><i>the strongest army</i>
<i>in the world at the time.</i></b>

03:56.190 --> 03:58.280
<b><i>As the enemy got near,</i>
<i>the Parthians attacked while they ran.</i></b>

03:58.360 --> 04:00.650
<b><i>They continued to fight</i>
<i>with hit-and-run tactics.</i></b>

04:00.740 --> 04:05.320
<b><i>The Roman army's heavy infantry, having</i>
<i>no way to retaliate, ran out of energy.</i></b>

04:08.740 --> 04:11.290
<b>Reverse shot on the opponent's head.
Three points!</b>

04:11.370 --> 04:12.410
<b>Right on!</b>

04:12.500 --> 04:13.920
<b>SUWA 6 - OGASAWARA 5</b>

04:14.000 --> 04:16.960
<b>With a score of six versus five,
Chojumaru wins!</b>

04:17.040 --> 04:18.500
<b>-Yes!
-You did it!</b>

04:18.590 --> 04:20.420
<b>Take that, punk! Go, Chojumaru!</b>

04:23.880 --> 04:26.600
<b>That's for shooting the shrine maiden.</b>

04:29.350 --> 04:32.100
<b>It was just a coincidence
I hit his ear, though.</b>

04:33.140 --> 04:34.850
<b>Congratulations on your victory.</b>

04:34.940 --> 04:35.940
<b>YORISHIGE APPEARED!</b>

04:36.020 --> 04:37.650
<b>Isn't it fun to fight while running away?</b>

04:37.730 --> 04:38.730
<b>TOKIYUKI - FIGHT - RUN</b>

04:38.820 --> 04:41.280
<b>We can continue
to come up with more and more ways!</b>

04:41.360 --> 04:45.030
<b>Now, Sadamune,
it's time to fulfill your promise.</b>

04:45.110 --> 04:49.990
<b>Leave Suwa
and don't meddle with us ever again.</b>

04:50.080 --> 04:52.120
<b>Don't be so full of yourself.</b>

04:52.700 --> 04:55.210
<b>A dog-shooting competition
is just for entertainment.</b>

04:55.290 --> 04:58.960
<b>You sided with traitors so your territory
should immediately be forfeit!</b>

04:59.040 --> 05:02.920
<b>I'll look thoroughly
for the Hojo survivors afterwards!</b>

05:03.010 --> 05:04.340
<b>HERE</b>

05:07.720 --> 05:09.720
<b><i>Damn Yorishige.</i></b>

05:09.810 --> 05:11.970
<b><i>Why did you bring out the kid?</i></b>

05:12.060 --> 05:15.190
<b><i>It's hard to believe</i>
<i>he had a sure chance of victory.</i></b>

05:15.270 --> 05:18.520
<b><i>And his mannerisms and behavior…</i></b>

05:18.610 --> 05:22.650
<b><i>He had the bearing of a nobleman</i>
<i>you don't usually see at his age.</i></b>

05:23.280 --> 05:26.990
<b><i>Could he be part of the Hojo family?</i></b>

05:27.990 --> 05:32.330
<b><i>No, Yorishige wouldn't bring forward such</i>
<i>an important person right in front of me!</i></b>

05:33.750 --> 05:36.080
<b><i>I don't understand</i>
<i>Yorishige's intentions at all!</i></b>

05:37.290 --> 05:38.790
<b>Sadamune has good eyes.</b>

05:39.290 --> 05:42.550
<b>He should be baffled
because he noticed too much.</b>

05:43.260 --> 05:45.380
<b>We have arranged with a certain individual</b>

05:45.470 --> 05:50.350
<b>to spread rumors of
the Hojo clan sightings all across Japan.</b>

05:51.220 --> 05:54.060
<b><i>Gods and people exist</i>
<i>only if you have faith.</i></b>

05:54.140 --> 05:56.560
<b><i>Simply believing in them gives them power.</i></b>

05:57.060 --> 06:01.440
<b><i>With suspicions abound</i>
<i>all throughout the country,</i></b>

06:01.520 --> 06:05.360
<b><i>our enemy's attention will be divided.</i></b>

06:05.440 --> 06:07.650
<b>May you grow strong.</b>

06:09.530 --> 06:11.580
<b>This is a battle you advance
while running.</b>

06:11.660 --> 06:15.370
<b>You're already running on the journey
to win back the country!</b>

06:19.960 --> 06:22.670
<b>THE ELUSIVE
SAMURAI</b>

07:42.290 --> 07:46.920
<b>THE ELUSIVE
SAMURAI</b>

07:48.170 --> 07:50.630
<b>"A useless and dishonorable skill
for a warrior."</b>

07:51.680 --> 07:55.850
<b>That's what they said
about the skills I've learned for my lord.</b>

07:56.510 --> 07:59.520
<b>The better I got at it,
the more trust I lost.</b>

08:00.180 --> 08:03.440
<b>The lord to whom I was long devoted
accused me of stealing from him.</b>

08:03.520 --> 08:05.020
<b>And I was banished.</b>

08:07.980 --> 08:12.030
<b>Listen. You are my successor.</b>

08:12.740 --> 08:15.410
<b>In my final hours, you will inherit
my name and my principles.</b>

08:17.370 --> 08:19.660
<b>Trust only money.</b>

08:19.750 --> 08:23.500
<b>Neither trust nor devotion will return
once you've lent them out.</b>

08:23.580 --> 08:28.710
<b>Use your skills
and trust only money, Genba!</b>

08:32.170 --> 08:33.880
<b>You can do it, my lord.</b>

08:33.970 --> 08:38.470
<b>One, two. One, two. One, two.</b>

08:38.560 --> 08:40.390
<b>Good work. A little more!</b>

08:40.470 --> 08:46.020
<b>Why does the heir to the shogunate
have to perform such physical labor?</b>

08:46.100 --> 08:50.570
<b>Right now,
you're Suwa Grand Shrine's Chojumaru.</b>

08:50.650 --> 08:55.450
<b>Enemies coming to visit will be suspicious
if we don't have you working already.</b>

08:55.530 --> 08:58.580
<b>The only enemy who would come is Sadamune.</b>

08:58.660 --> 09:00.870
<b>But he suffered huge embarrassment
just yesterday,</b>

09:00.950 --> 09:03.710
<b>so he probably won't
show his face for a while.</b>

09:03.790 --> 09:04.750
<b>Hi!</b>

09:04.830 --> 09:05.870
<b>-What?
-What?</b>

09:05.960 --> 09:07.500
<b>He's here with a smile.</b>

09:07.580 --> 09:09.170
<b>What a resilient man.</b>

09:09.800 --> 09:11.960
<b>I've kept you waiting, Suwa folk.</b>

09:12.050 --> 09:14.380
<b>I bring an Imperial Command.</b>

09:14.470 --> 09:15.800
<b>An Imperial Command?</b>

09:15.880 --> 09:17.760
<b>Didn't he bring one last time?</b>

09:18.760 --> 09:19.760
<b>COMMENTARY MORITAKA SUWA</b>

09:19.850 --> 09:22.220
<b>The Imperial Command from the other day
was appointing Sadamune as governor.</b>

09:23.100 --> 09:24.640
<b>Today's Command is probably…</b>

09:25.140 --> 09:28.020
<b>"You are traitors
who have sided with Hojo.</b>

09:28.110 --> 09:30.320
<b>As punishment,
the Suwa clan and their retainers</b>

09:30.400 --> 09:33.690
<b>must forfeit the lands
north of Lake Suwa to Ogasawara."</b>

09:33.780 --> 09:34.950
<b>FORFEITURE</b>

09:35.530 --> 09:36.700
<b>You're lying.</b>

09:37.200 --> 09:42.540
<b>Within ten days, retainers living in
the corresponding regions must relocate.</b>

09:42.620 --> 09:46.330
<b>Deliver the news with dignity
like a good lord.</b>

09:54.590 --> 09:57.180
<b>What should we do?</b>

09:57.260 --> 10:00.550
<b>We've cultivated this land tirelessly
since our ancestor's time!</b>

10:00.640 --> 10:03.520
<b>We can't just hand it over
to that Sadamune creep without a struggle.</b>

10:03.600 --> 10:04.640
<b>That's right!</b>

10:04.730 --> 10:07.060
<b>We must go to war.</b>

10:07.730 --> 10:10.020
<b>Lord Yorishige, please command us.</b>

10:12.820 --> 10:15.440
<b>If we go against the Imperial Command
and go to war,</b>

10:15.530 --> 10:17.280
<b>we'll become an enemy of the court.</b>

10:17.820 --> 10:19.660
<b>Now is not the time to rise up.</b>

10:20.950 --> 10:23.740
<b>That's enough for today.
Everyone, you're free to go.</b>

10:25.540 --> 10:26.960
<b>-Chojumaru.
-Yes.</b>

10:27.500 --> 10:29.330
<b>Stay behind. I have a task for you.</b>

10:29.880 --> 10:30.880
<b>What?</b>

10:31.920 --> 10:34.460
<b>I see you've named yourselves
the Elusive Warriors.</b>

10:35.260 --> 10:37.630
<b>It's a good name. It suits you.</b>

10:38.260 --> 10:40.090
<b>I don't feel like that's a compliment.</b>

10:40.680 --> 10:42.760
<b>Anyways, what are you going to do?</b>

10:44.560 --> 10:46.560
<b>At this rate, the people of Suwa…</b>

10:48.770 --> 10:52.610
<b>You understand reason
and have a sense of justice.</b>

10:52.690 --> 10:55.110
<b>But having those two qualities
is not enough.</b>

10:57.240 --> 11:01.320
<b>In fact, there's someone I want to recruit
to the Elusive Warriors.</b>

11:01.410 --> 11:02.240
<b>What?</b>

11:02.320 --> 11:05.410
<b>He's a thief named Genba Kazama.</b>

11:05.490 --> 11:06.660
<b>A thief?</b>

11:06.750 --> 11:08.250
<b>He uses all sorts of trickery.</b>

11:08.330 --> 11:11.920
<b>He can also get in anywhere
and steal anything.</b>

11:12.000 --> 11:13.000
<b>Wow!</b>

11:13.540 --> 11:15.000
<b>But,</b>

11:15.090 --> 11:17.090
<b>why do we want a thief in our company?</b>

11:17.170 --> 11:19.550
<b>There's something I want to ask of you.</b>

11:20.180 --> 11:25.010
<b>Have him go into Sadamune's residence
and steal the Emperor's Imperial Command.</b>

11:27.220 --> 11:28.930
<b><i>According to information from Kyo,</i></b>

11:29.020 --> 11:32.100
<b><i>it's taking quite some time</i>
<i>to issue Imperial Commands.</i></b>

11:32.190 --> 11:34.820
<b><i>If this one goes missing,</i>
<i>it'll buy us a good amount of time.</i></b>

11:34.900 --> 11:35.900
<b>END OF THE LINE</b>

11:35.980 --> 11:37.990
<b>This is so wrong.</b>

11:38.070 --> 11:40.200
<b>Yes. But in the world we're joining,</b>

11:40.280 --> 11:43.490
<b>you'll need more than righteousness
to bring forth justice.</b>

11:46.120 --> 11:48.500
<b>You shall learn to make use
of wicked people as retainers too.</b>

11:48.580 --> 11:51.500
<b>You'll be prepared as a general
with everything in your arsenal.</b>

11:54.880 --> 11:57.000
<b>Are you sure, Lord Yorishige?</b>

11:57.090 --> 12:00.550
<b>Letting the children
and Lord Tokiyuki go by themselves?</b>

12:00.630 --> 12:02.970
<b>He's a child, but he is a ruler's child.</b>

12:03.590 --> 12:06.680
<b>You are sure to see
he is fit to be a lord.</b>

12:14.310 --> 12:15.480
<b>KIKYOGAHARA</b>

12:20.320 --> 12:22.400
<b>He should be in this village somewhere.</b>

12:24.660 --> 12:26.120
<b>Excuse me.</b>

12:26.200 --> 12:27.030
<b>Yes?</b>

12:27.120 --> 12:29.240
<b>May I ask a question?</b>

12:29.790 --> 12:32.040
<b>What is it, you beautiful, young ladies?</b>

12:32.120 --> 12:34.040
<b>We're looking for someone.</b>

12:34.120 --> 12:36.540
<b>Oh, I see. Do you know their name?</b>

12:36.630 --> 12:38.550
<b>Yes. Genba Kazama.</b>

12:39.210 --> 12:41.340
<b>Genba Kazama.</b>

12:41.420 --> 12:44.260
<b>Genba Kazama.</b>

12:44.340 --> 12:47.220
<b>Genba Kazama.</b>

12:47.300 --> 12:49.140
<b>…is his name.</b>

13:03.110 --> 13:04.320
<b>How bad do they hate him?</b>

13:04.400 --> 13:06.870
<b>It's loud and clear
they want nothing to do with him.</b>

13:07.490 --> 13:09.540
<b>No one dares to get on my bad side.</b>

13:10.330 --> 13:13.830
<b>If someone makes an enemy of me,
they're sure to see hell.</b>

13:16.920 --> 13:18.090
<b>He's in the tree!</b>

13:18.170 --> 13:20.170
<b>For some reason,
our lord is also in the tree!</b>

13:21.090 --> 13:22.800
<b>My name is Genba Kazama.</b>

13:23.420 --> 13:26.760
<b>I heard my name from
about ten kilometers away, so I've come.</b>

13:29.640 --> 13:31.010
<b>State your business.</b>

13:31.970 --> 13:34.690
<b>I'm Chojumaru of Suwa Grand Shrine.</b>

13:35.230 --> 13:38.020
<b>I wanted to personally add you
as my retainer.</b>

13:39.230 --> 13:40.980
<b>What do you mean, "Chojumaru"?</b>

13:41.570 --> 13:43.490
<b>You're Hojo's brat, aren't you?</b>

13:44.150 --> 13:47.320
<b>I wonder how much you'd go for
if I sold you to Sadamune.</b>

13:49.410 --> 13:50.740
<b>Young Lord, get away!</b>

13:50.830 --> 13:53.620
<b>Damn it. I knew we couldn't trust a thief.</b>

13:53.700 --> 13:55.660
<b>Don't be in a hurry, you idiots.</b>

13:55.750 --> 13:57.580
<b>Negotiations are just beginning.</b>

14:02.170 --> 14:03.590
<b>-My wallet!
-My wallet!</b>

14:03.670 --> 14:04.880
<b>TO BE BIG IS A GOOD THING</b>

14:04.970 --> 14:06.840
<b>What skill!</b>

14:06.930 --> 14:08.550
<b>My skill isn't cheap.</b>

14:09.970 --> 14:12.680
<b>I want 100 kanmon
for not ratting you out to Sadamune.</b>

14:12.760 --> 14:13.770
<b>100 KANMON = FIVE MILLION YEN</b>

14:13.850 --> 14:15.640
<b>100 kanmon for each job I perform!</b>

14:15.730 --> 14:17.190
<b>That's so expensive!</b>

14:18.100 --> 14:19.100
<b>Money?</b>

14:19.190 --> 14:22.480
<b>I won't let you get away with even
a single mon's worth of discount.</b>

14:22.570 --> 14:26.070
<b>If you want my help, money is the thing
that'll tie us together.</b>

14:28.280 --> 14:29.490
<b>Money.</b>

14:30.370 --> 14:33.290
<b><i>If he's shocked at this point,</i>
<i>we're not getting anywhere.</i></b>

14:33.910 --> 14:36.460
<b><i>If you don't have money, you can't</i>
<i>get anyone to do anything for you.</i></b>

14:36.540 --> 14:38.870
<b><i>I don't care how royal</i>
<i>the house you came from is.</i></b>

14:38.960 --> 14:42.290
<b><i>Right now, you're just a brat</i>
<i>who can't do anything.</i></b>

14:42.380 --> 14:44.550
<b><i>You're not fit to be a lord.</i></b>

14:44.630 --> 14:47.300
<b><i>This is reality, brat!</i></b>

14:48.430 --> 14:50.840
<b>So, I just have to pay you?</b>

14:50.930 --> 14:51.930
<b>Yes.</b>

14:52.760 --> 14:54.430
<b><i>If you can!</i></b>

14:54.520 --> 14:56.560
<b><i>Are you planning on taking out a loan?</i></b>

14:59.560 --> 15:02.440
<b>Are you sure that's enough?
You don't want a province?</b>

15:02.520 --> 15:03.520
<b>What?</b>

15:05.530 --> 15:07.570
<b>-A province?
-To be honest, I was surprised.</b>

15:08.360 --> 15:09.660
<b><i>If you become my retainer</i></b>

15:09.740 --> 15:12.910
<b><i>and help me recapture the country</i>
<i>with your incredible talent,</i></b>

15:12.990 --> 15:16.080
<b><i>you'd be an original distinguished vassal</i>
<i>from the start of the war.</i></b>

15:16.830 --> 15:17.660
<b>KAI - MUSASHI</b>

15:17.750 --> 15:20.830
<b><i>It would be a no-brainer to give you</i>
<i>a province, like Kai or Musashi.</i></b>

15:21.420 --> 15:23.590
<b>How unselfish you are.</b>

15:23.670 --> 15:27.090
<b>You ask not for a province,
but only for money!</b>

15:27.670 --> 15:31.800
<b><i>Kai? Musashi?</i></b>

15:32.550 --> 15:34.260
<b>I'm shocked.</b>

15:34.850 --> 15:37.140
<b>Slowly. There we go.</b>

15:37.220 --> 15:39.520
<b>I would be confused too.</b>

15:41.440 --> 15:46.400
<b>The Suwa Grand Shrine will guarantee
payment for your daily expenses.</b>

15:46.980 --> 15:49.570
<b>But are you sure cash is really okay?</b>

15:51.280 --> 15:54.620
<b>Once Big Brother takes the country
and gives you a province,</b>

15:54.700 --> 15:57.160
<b>you'll gain tens of thousands of kanmon.</b>

15:57.700 --> 16:00.080
<b>E-V-E-R-Y year.</b>

16:00.750 --> 16:02.750
<b>I get it, I get it.
This really is a gamble.</b>

16:03.420 --> 16:05.290
<b>Take a small amount now</b>

16:05.380 --> 16:07.840
<b>or bet on future returns
by serving my lord.</b>

16:08.380 --> 16:09.720
<b>But,</b>

16:09.800 --> 16:13.680
<b>you won't bet on this dream of a gamble?</b>

16:13.760 --> 16:16.430
<b>The ruler's child
helplessly coming to you for a favor</b>

16:16.510 --> 16:19.560
<b>will only happen once in a lifetime.</b>

16:20.680 --> 16:22.730
<b>Stop whispering in both of my ears!</b>

16:22.810 --> 16:24.230
<b>Let me decide for myself!</b>

16:25.480 --> 16:29.400
<b><i>Damn it. I was thinking of fooling them</i>
<i>and swindling some money.</i></b>

16:30.320 --> 16:31.320
<b><i>But, it's fine.</i></b>

16:31.400 --> 16:32.990
<b>This might stain.</b>

16:33.070 --> 16:34.070
<b>Hey, brat.</b>

16:34.570 --> 16:37.490
<b>You said you wanted me to steal
the Emperor's Imperial Command.</b>

16:38.240 --> 16:39.410
<b>I have one condition.</b>

16:40.080 --> 16:41.500
<b>OGASAWARA'S RESIDENCE</b>

16:41.580 --> 16:44.000
<b>The Emperor's Imperial Command
was very effective.</b>

16:44.080 --> 16:50.050
<b>I'll chip away at Suwa's territories,
and soon it'll all be mine!</b>

16:51.760 --> 16:55.010
<b>I'm not planning on risking my life
for an irresponsible employer.</b>

16:55.510 --> 16:58.180
<b>I'll take the job
only if you're willing to come with me.</b>

16:59.140 --> 17:01.140
<b>The Imperial Command is in that warehouse.</b>

17:03.020 --> 17:05.150
<b>Just as the shrine maiden said.</b>

17:06.770 --> 17:08.570
<b>I thought you'd be too scared to come.</b>

17:08.650 --> 17:10.320
<b>Of course I'll come with you.</b>

17:10.900 --> 17:14.490
<b>I was the one that was told to go steal
the Imperial Command.</b>

17:14.570 --> 17:16.570
<b>Oh, you are so admirable.</b>

17:16.660 --> 17:18.030
<b>But be careful.</b>

17:19.030 --> 17:20.870
<b>If we mess up, we'll end up like them.</b>

17:20.950 --> 17:23.120
<b>THE THIEVES</b>

17:25.080 --> 17:26.500
<b>Can we trust him?</b>

17:26.580 --> 17:30.000
<b>What if he takes our lord to a place
he can't escape and sells him out?</b>

17:30.090 --> 17:31.550
<b>It's going to be okay.</b>

17:31.630 --> 17:34.380
<b>Lord Yorishige is the one
who recommended him.</b>

17:34.970 --> 17:39.470
<b>We, too, simply became
the Young Lord's retainers one day.</b>

17:40.010 --> 17:41.850
<b>And it's been fun, right?</b>

17:42.890 --> 17:47.100
<b>Well, that's true.
I don't tire of that lord.</b>

17:47.190 --> 17:48.610
<b>KING</b>

17:49.190 --> 17:51.530
<b>Three tightly secured locks.</b>

17:51.610 --> 17:53.070
<b>Can you open it?</b>

17:53.150 --> 17:54.440
<b>That's nothing.</b>

17:55.610 --> 17:58.700
<b>The problem is the two guards
in front of the warehouse.</b>

17:58.780 --> 18:02.120
<b>In the end, people are the best locks.</b>

18:02.200 --> 18:05.620
<b>But my special skill
is getting through those locks.</b>

18:19.800 --> 18:21.890
<b><i>Follow me if you've got the guts.</i></b>

18:22.760 --> 18:25.430
<b>BOUNCE</b>

18:25.520 --> 18:27.640
<b><i>He's so excited.</i></b>

18:29.150 --> 18:31.940
<b><i>Are you the type to do</i>
<i>whatever someone tells you to do?</i></b>

18:32.520 --> 18:36.110
<b><i>You're the child of a high-ranking</i>
<i>warrior. Do you not have any shame?</i></b>

18:36.200 --> 18:37.780
<b><i>A warrior's shame?</i></b>

18:37.860 --> 18:40.530
<b><i>I threw most of that away</i>
<i>when I ran from Kamakura.</i></b>

18:41.030 --> 18:42.990
<b><i>And I'm not doing this</i>
<i>just because I was told to.</i></b>

18:43.080 --> 18:45.700
<b><i>I want to repay my debt</i>
<i>to the people of Suwa.</i></b>

18:45.790 --> 18:50.210
<b><i>If I can repay the people</i>
<i>who warmly took me in,</i></b>

18:50.710 --> 18:53.300
<b><i>I don't see that as a disgrace.</i></b>

18:54.420 --> 18:55.630
<b>That's stupid.</b>

18:55.710 --> 18:57.510
<b>Listen, birdbrain.</b>

18:58.180 --> 19:02.760
<b>Exchanges through obligations or honor
will eventually lead to loss.</b>

19:02.850 --> 19:05.560
<b>If you can't physically see it,
it might as well not exist.</b>

19:05.640 --> 19:09.390
<b>But offer money or instill fear,
and you can get people to do anything.</b>

19:09.480 --> 19:11.900
<b>Money or fear?</b>

19:11.980 --> 19:16.570
<b>For example, there was a woman
who refused to pay me after the fact</b>

19:16.650 --> 19:19.110
<b>for investigating her husband's affair.</b>

19:19.200 --> 19:21.110
<b><i>So I snuck into her house.</i></b>

19:21.200 --> 19:23.910
<b><i>I put roaches and pee in some rice.</i></b>

19:24.910 --> 19:26.910
<b><i>And I cooked it up</i>
<i>nice and fluffy for her.</i></b>

19:27.620 --> 19:30.920
<b>Ever since then,
no one's dared to snub me.</b>

19:31.420 --> 19:34.340
<b><i>Oh, I see why no one likes him.</i></b>

19:35.380 --> 19:37.460
<b>People only believe in what they can see.</b>

19:38.170 --> 19:39.380
<b>Genba?</b>

19:40.380 --> 19:41.680
<b>Don't move.</b>

19:53.110 --> 19:54.020
<b>Hey.</b>

19:54.110 --> 19:54.940
<b><i>Sadamune?</i></b>

19:55.650 --> 19:56.860
<b><i>I can't be here.</i></b>

19:57.860 --> 19:59.320
<b><i>But where should I go?</i></b>

19:59.860 --> 20:02.160
<b><i>Plus, Genba told me not to move.</i></b>

20:02.240 --> 20:03.450
<b><i>Genba?</i></b>

20:03.990 --> 20:06.910
<b><i>What if he planned</i>
<i>to lure me here to begin with.</i></b>

20:08.000 --> 20:09.160
<b>Sir!</b>

20:09.250 --> 20:12.830
<b>The nails
on the warehouse's northern end are loose.</b>

20:13.540 --> 20:15.040
<b>Go fix it immediately.</b>

20:15.130 --> 20:18.800
<b>But we've been commanded
to not leave the warehouse.</b>

20:18.880 --> 20:19.880
<b>You idiots!</b>

20:20.970 --> 20:24.010
<b>What if the enemy attacks tonight?</b>

20:24.090 --> 20:26.470
<b>Will you atone for your mistakes
with your heads?</b>

20:26.560 --> 20:29.060
<b>I wasn't thinking. I'll fix it right away!</b>

20:30.980 --> 20:34.690
<b>Sir. By the way,
why do you have those ears?</b>

20:35.230 --> 20:37.070
<b>I want people to think I'm cute!</b>

20:37.150 --> 20:38.530
<b>Did it work?</b>

20:38.610 --> 20:39.740
<b>Yes!</b>

20:39.820 --> 20:43.070
<b>It snuck up on me like a night ambush,
but it's right up my alley!</b>

20:46.740 --> 20:47.870
<b>KING</b>

20:48.450 --> 20:51.210
<b>This mask
is made of secret ancestral clay.</b>

20:51.290 --> 20:53.040
<b>I can morph into most people.</b>

20:53.790 --> 20:58.840
<b><i>Did he know who I was</i>
<i>because he'd morphed into someone I know</i></b>

20:59.630 --> 21:02.010
<b><i>and snuck into Suwa Grand Shrine?</i></b>

21:02.670 --> 21:05.800
<b>I know
you thought I deceived you just then.</b>

21:07.140 --> 21:09.430
<b>Is this what
the Imperial Command looks like?</b>

21:14.770 --> 21:15.600
<b>Genba?</b>

21:15.690 --> 21:18.480
<b>Someone who can steal anything,
morph into anyone.</b>

21:19.150 --> 21:22.030
<b>Anyone would distrust
a subordinate like that.</b>

21:22.690 --> 21:26.370
<b>Can you trust me enough to hire me?</b>

21:27.370 --> 21:31.330
<b>Young Lord, you were already betrayed
by a million soldiers.</b>

21:32.040 --> 21:34.080
<b><i>I hear something in the warehouse.</i></b>

21:34.160 --> 21:36.580
<b><i>Whispers. Two male kids?</i></b>

21:37.250 --> 21:38.670
<b><i>What happened to the guards?</i></b>

21:40.420 --> 21:41.800
<b><i>They're at the northern wall?</i></b>

21:41.880 --> 21:43.340
<b><i>Why would they be there?</i></b>

21:47.010 --> 21:48.010
<b>-Goro.
-Sir!</b>

21:48.100 --> 21:50.010
<b>Go wake Sadamune.</b>

21:50.100 --> 21:51.930
<b>Hikohachiro, go wake the retainers.</b>

21:52.020 --> 21:53.810
<b>Setaro, go communicate with the gate.</b>

21:53.890 --> 21:54.890
<b>Sir!</b>

21:58.020 --> 22:00.770
<b>If they hadn't put me in here
on this moonless night,</b>

22:00.860 --> 22:03.650
<b>I wouldn't have had to
cut some rascals' throats.</b>

23:33.660 --> 23:35.660
<b>Translated by Emily Walton</b>

23:39.000 --> 23:39.830
<b>EPISODE 6 (YEAR OF 1333):
STEAL THE IMPERIAL COMMAND FROM
OGASAWARA'S RESIDENCE AT NIGHT</b>

23:39.000 --> 23:39.830
<b><i>Let's go!</i></b>
